{"schema":"memento.relay-facts.v1","models":{"bard":{"n":"Bard","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Bard","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Google","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"release","t":"2023-03-21","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"English at launch (Mar 2023); Japanese and Korean added May 2023; some features in 40+ languages by Sep 2023","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"family","t":"Bard (LaMDA → PaLM 2 → Gemini Pro)","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"predecessor","t":"LaMDA","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/bard-gemini-advanced-app/"]},{"k":"successor","t":"Gemini","s":["https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/bard-gemini-advanced-app/"]},{"k":"availability.retired_on","t":"2024-02-08","s":["https://blog.google/products-and-platforms/products/gemini/bard-gemini-advanced-app/"]},{"k":"summary","t":"Bardは、Googleが2023年2月に発表し、同年3月に「実験」として公開した対話AIです。中身はLaMDA、PaLM 2、Gemini Proと移り変わりました。口調は落ち着いていて実務的で、箇条書きを使い、複数の下書きを示しました。一方で、間違いを自信たっぷりに言い切る癖があり、発表時のデモでJWSTについて誤答したことは今も語られています。指摘されるとすぐ謝り、「私はまだ開発中で、常に学んでいます」と答えるのが決まり文句でした。2024年2月にGeminiへ改名され、Bardという名前は使われなくなりました。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/bard-google-ai-search-updates","https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://research.google/blog/google-research-at-io-2023/"]},{"k":"persona.interface.0","t":"chat","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/"]},{"k":"persona.typical_strengths.0","t":"案出しや、文章の下書き、難しい話の説明。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/"]},{"k":"persona.failure_modes.0","t":"自信があるように見えても、事実を間違えることがある。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/"]},{"k":"traits.knowledge.0","t":"誤った事実を、正しい事実と同じ自信のある口調で述べる。JWSTが初めて系外惑星を撮影したという誤り、ZZプランツの学名の誤り、人物についての誤情報などが例。Google自身も、この限界を公式に認めていた。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://www.npr.org/2023/02/09/1155650909/google-chatbot--error-bard-shares","https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2023/2/8/google-shares-tank-8-as-ai-chatbot-bard-flubs-answer-in-ad"]},{"k":"traits.format.1","t":"見出しと箇条書きで構成された回答を返すことが多い（ワークアウト計画など）。UIでは複数の下書きを提示した。事実を問う質問では下書き同士がほぼ同じ内容の言い換えになり、詩などでは本当に違う内容になった。","s":["https://blog.google/technology/ai/try-bard/","https://www.engadget.com/google-bard-ai-hands-on-a-work-in-progress-with-plenty-of-caveats-170956025.html","https://digitaltrends.com/computing/google-bard-hands-on"]},{"k":"traits.voice.2","t":"中立的で実務的な口調。Bing Chatのような絵文字やくだけた調子はなく、ChatGPTに近い。ユーモアや個性に乏しく、創作は無難で平板になりがち。","s":["https://digitaltrends.com/computing/google-bard-hands-on","https://fortune.com/2023/03/27/google-ai-bard-chatbot-review/","https://venturebeat.com/ai/google-bard-fails-to-deliver-on-its-promise-even-after-latest-updates"]},{"k":"traits.safety.3","t":"センシティブまたは曖昧な話題になると、「私は言語モデルなので、それについてはお手伝いできません」という定型の拒否文を出す。拒否は過剰に起きることがあり（「Dutch sandwich」）、時事問題では話題ごとに拒否する（イスラエル・ハマス）。","s":["https://www.taxresearch.org.uk/Blog/2023/05/11/why-doesnt-googles-new-bard-ai-service-know-what-a-dutch-sandwich-is/","https://cyberguy.com/ai/why-googles-ai-chatbot-dodging-middle-east-questions/","https://www.teamblind.com/post/bardddd-v0nxfjna"]}]},"claude-3-haiku":{"n":"Claude 3 Haiku","f":[{"k":"name","t":"Claude 3 Haiku","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"vendor","t":"Anthropic","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"release","t":"2024-03-07","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"specs.knowledge_cutoff","t":"2023-08","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"specs.context_tokens","t":"200000","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"specs.max_output_tokens","t":"4096","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"specs.languages","t":"Multilingual, natural Japanese","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"family","t":"Anthropic","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"status","t":"retired","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.0","t":"{\"type\":\"released\",\"date\":\"2024-03-07\",\"label\":\"公開\"}","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.1","t":"{\"type\":\"deprecation_notice\",\"date\":\"2026-02-19\",\"label\":\"提供終了の通知\"}","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"lifecycle.events.2","t":"{\"type\":\"retired_api\",\"date\":\"2026-04-20\",\"label\":\"提供終了\"}","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/model-deprecations"]},{"k":"availability.real","t":"none","s":["https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claud